# Declaring props in `<script setup>`

Prefer **destructuring `defineProps`** and access props by name directly.

## ❌ Avoid

```ts
const props = defineProps<{ store: IStoreResponse }>();
props.store
```

## ✅ Prefer

```ts
const { store, lag = 100 } = defineProps<{
	store: IStoreResponse;
	lag?: number;
}>();
// then: store, lag
```

Set default values for optional props **in the destructuring pattern**.
